\qquad
N_{e^-}-N_{e^+}=\hbox{constant}.$ In the hot soup $N_{e^-}+N_{e^+}$ is of the same order as $N_\gamma$, whereas the surviving excess is of the same order as the much smaller proton number. Hence the rounded ratio is $\boxed{
